    "header_meaning": "8 O0/O2 static/PIC profiles per core, 4096 inputs and 110592 checks per profile. Actual MMX/SSE/AVX2, carry/borrow, CRC32C, x87 after EMMS and full EBX/RBX preservation execute. HRESET and AVX-512 are compile-only.",
    "source_meaning": "Each of six SDK/compiler runs compiles 48 HighC/LLVMC exports and wraps eight original ELF objects at O0/O2: 112 profiles, 4096 inputs each. HRESET opcode/operands are independently decoded, then replaced by a trap which observes EAX and resumes to check the original source return. The 32-bit and 64-bit wrong-control mutations fail for both native frontends.",
